    "updated_at": "2022-10-26T08:11:41Z",
    "body": "I can kinda understand wanting to separate this information in some way, but I second @domenic's recommendation of using messages, perhaps with special names that make them easier to filter on the client.\r\n\r\nIt seems highly unlikely we'd further extend the `EventSource` feature.",
