    "created_at": "2022-10-27T06:28:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-27T06:28:46Z",
    "body": "It's not widely used and can easily be written in \"userland\" on top of fetch. We didn't have good response stream support back in the day, but we do now. There's also alternatives such as WebSockets that have somewhat broader adoption and allow for bidirectional communication, and there's even more alternatives on the horizon (WebTransport comes to mind).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
